don't let those long nights get to you

24:09.748 --> 24:15.320
Let's welcome the sun

24:15.320 --> 24:18.623
Give a firm "Good morning"
to the morning rays

24:18.623 --> 24:21.860
Sparkling even inside your heart

24:21.860 --> 24:27.999
I love that you get up
no matter how many times you fall

24:27.999 --> 24:31.303
Never forget to smile
and looking towards tomorrow

24:31.303 --> 24:34.673
Let's carefully etch today
into our memory

